"entity": {
"name": "Iveco Group NV",
"description": "Iveco Group NV is a holding company. It engages in the design, production, marketing, sale, servicing, and financing of trucks, commercial vehicles, buses and specialty vehicles for firefighting, defense and other uses, as well as combustion engines, alternative propulsion systems, transmissions and axles for those vehicles and engines and alternative propulsion systems for agricultural and construction equipment and for marine and power generation applications. The firm operates through the following segments: Commercial and Specialty Vehicles, Powertrain, and Financial Services Segment. The Commercial and Specialty Vehicles segment designs, manufactures and distributes light, medium, and heavy vehicles for the transportation and distribution of goods under the IVECO brand, city-buses, commuter buses under the IVECO BUS and HEULIEZ BUS brands, quarry and mining equipment under the IVECO ASTRA brand, firefighting vehicles under the Magirus brand, and vehicles for civil defense and peace-keeping missions under the Iveco Defence Vehicles brand. The Powertrain segment, designs, manufactures and distributes, under the FPT Industrial brand, a combustion engines, alternative propulsion systems, transmission systems and axles for on- and off-road applications, as well as for marine and power generation. The Financial Services segment, offers financial products and services to dealers and customers and also administers retail financing to customers for the purchase or lease of new and used vehicles sold by brand dealers and distributors of the Group. The company was founded on June 16, 2021 and is headquartered in Turin, Italy.",
"rbics_econ": "Industrials",
"rbics_sector": "Industrial Manufacturing",
"rbics_subsector": "Transportation Equipment Manufacturing",
"rbics_indgrp": "Commercial Transportation Equipment Manufacturing",
"country_of_risk": "IT"
